8173
00:02:44,727 --> 00:02:45,167
m 22 22 b 22 22 22 22 22 22 b 17 14 20 4 33 0 b 15 7 22 19 25 22 b 22 9 41 1 50 15 b 37 0 22 15 28 22 b 47 13 54 37 41 45 b 55 32 40 16 29 24 b 51 26 39 63 14 43 b 38 64 50 24 27 26 b 32 46 0 46 3 24 b 2 46 29 42 24 27 b 17 40 -11 21 13 4 b -10 22 20 40 22 22

8174
00:02:45,127 --> 00:02:46,147
iu

8175
00:02:52,717 --> 00:02:55,047
Power to change the world

8176
00:02:58,047 --> 00:03:00,987
This sacred battle is a part of our doctrine.

8177
00:03:01,767 --> 00:03:03,767
I don't want any outsider interfering with it.

8178
00:03:04,507 --> 00:03:06,547
Sacret battle, is it?

8179
00:03:07,287 --> 00:03:11,507
And is that supposed to be the power of god that you've acquired after conquering the legendary tower?

8180
00:03:12,787 --> 00:03:16,207
Well, I admit that you've acquired this power on your own.

8181
00:03:16,527 --> 00:03:18,287
And its up to you what you want to do with it.

8182
00:03:19,267 --> 00:03:21,807
But, its definitely not something one gets by the grace of god.

8183
00:03:22,747 --> 00:03:27,287
In fact, anyone can get this power if they conquer a dungeon.

8184
00:03:27,947 --> 00:03:33,407
What I mean to say is that, this power is not at all related to your doctrine in any way.

8185
00:03:33,987 --> 00:03:35,547
And who are you to say that?

8186
00:03:35,687 --> 00:03:37,007
Sinbad.

8187
00:03:37,267 --> 00:03:39,167
A trader who travels all around the seas.

8188
00:03:39,847 --> 00:03:43,607
And, a conqueror just like you.

8189
00:03:45,127 --> 00:03:47,467
Well, let's have a duel.

8190
00:03:48,107 --> 00:03:52,847
As you can see I'm quite talkative and if left alone I may end up speaking things I shouldn't.

8191
00:03:53,487 --> 00:03:56,807
So if you win, you can dispose me off in any way you like.

8192
00:03:57,327 --> 00:03:58,687
What're you after?

8193
00:03:59,227 --> 00:04:00,227
I'll have him

8194
00:04:03,787 --> 00:04:07,467
and have you sign a trade link with my corporation.

8195
00:04:08,607 --> 00:04:10,687
A duel with the Knight King!?

8196
00:04:11,207 --> 00:04:13,347
What is that man even saying...?

8197
00:04:13,847 --> 00:04:15,887
Capture that ruffian!

8198
00:04:16,147 --> 00:04:19,527
But, that power from earlier was certainly from the god.

8199
00:04:19,807 --> 00:04:23,487
Wasn't that supposed to be only handled by a Knight King?

8200
00:04:23,967 --> 00:04:26,827
I see. So that's what you were after, Sin!

8201
00:04:27,567 --> 00:04:33,287
As per their teaching, the people here believe that only a Knight King can use the power of a Djinn.

8202
00:04:33,867 --> 00:04:36,347
But, that's not the truth at all.

8203
00:04:36,987 --> 00:04:37,787
In other words.

8204
00:04:38,127 --> 00:04:43,047
If this goes on, the uncertainty surrounding the Knight King will raise questions about the doctrine itself.

8205
00:04:43,467 --> 00:04:44,687
I see...

8206
00:04:45,127 --> 00:04:48,307
...so he's hitting where it hurts the most, huh?

8207
00:04:49,167 --> 00:04:51,467
So what will it be?

8208
00:04:52,007 --> 00:04:53,667
Will you accept it?

8209
00:04:54,427 --> 00:04:56,627
You are a very rude and an impudent person.

8210
00:04:57,327 --> 00:05:00,507
but that makes sense as you're an outsider.

8211
00:05:01,627 --> 00:05:04,507
That person over there is an apprentice Knight who has just lost in a sacred battle.

8212
00:05:05,147 --> 00:05:07,387
His judgment can wait for a while.

8213
00:05:08,607 --> 00:05:12,127
However, I can't overlook something that could affect the entire nation.

8214
00:05:13,487 --> 00:05:16,447
That's why I'll accept this duel.

8215
00:05:17,647 --> 00:05:19,707
You can't, Sinbad!

8216
00:05:21,427 --> 00:05:23,227
You can't beat him.

8217
00:05:23,487 --> 00:05:24,447
Mystras?

8218
00:05:24,747 --> 00:05:27,807
Any type of attack is meaningless before that power.

8219
00:05:28,327 --> 00:05:31,947
All his sides are being guarded by those impregnable walls.

8220
00:05:32,427 --> 00:05:37,347
Not to mention, the stronger the attack is, the harder it is reflected back after being amplified several times.

8221
00:05:38,107 --> 00:05:40,187
You might even die if you're not careful with your approach.

8222
00:05:40,807 --> 00:05:41,747
Is that so...

8223
00:05:42,387 --> 00:05:43,527
Sinbad!?

8224
00:05:43,787 --> 00:05:46,147
It's impossible to stop him now.

8225
00:05:46,387 --> 00:05:47,747
But if this goes onâ

8226
00:05:48,227 --> 00:05:51,687
Sin is purposely using that attitude in order to provoke him.

8227
00:05:52,407 --> 00:05:54,927
Which means he has something up his sleeves.

8228
00:05:56,187 --> 00:05:59,187
So just trust our master.

8229
00:06:03,767 --> 00:06:04,787
How childish!

8230
00:06:07,347 --> 00:06:09,427
Now it's my turn to attack!

8231
00:06:14,187 --> 00:06:17,727
As expected of someone who holds the title of a Knight King.

8232
00:06:18,027 --> 00:06:18,687
In that case,

8233
00:06:19,447 --> 00:06:20,807
Bararaq!

8234
00:06:42,607 --> 00:06:43,607
Amazing...

8235
00:06:43,707 --> 00:06:46,027
I've never seen a fight like this.

8236
00:06:46,027 --> 00:06:48,607
To be able to fight equally with the Knight King...

8237
00:06:49,367 --> 00:06:50,367
Equal...?

8238
00:06:50,807 --> 00:06:54,227
How regrettable to be measured as an equal in a battle of this level.

8239
00:06:55,007 --> 00:07:00,407
I honestly think your power is quite good,
but only if its in a complete state.

8240
00:07:01,327 --> 00:07:02,247
Let me show you...

8241
00:07:11,887 --> 00:07:12,787
This is...!?

8242
00:07:13,967 --> 00:07:15,827
<i>O' Spirit of wrath and heroes...</i>

8243
00:07:16,487 --> 00:07:21,107
<i>Dwell in me and turn me into a great demon!</i>

8244
00:07:23,047 --> 00:07:25,787
Sin, don't tell me you've mastered it!?

8245
00:07:26,247 --> 00:07:27,157
Full

8246
00:07:27,247 --> 00:07:28,157
Body

8247
00:07:28,247 --> 00:07:29,157
Djinn

8248
00:07:29,207 --> 00:07:30,157
Equip

8249
00:07:31,947 --> 00:07:33,207
Djinn Equip Baal!

8250
00:07:38,207 --> 00:07:40,027
Covering yourself in the powers of Djinn,

8251
00:07:40,307 --> 00:07:42,027
and turning yourself into a demon.

8252
00:07:42,987 --> 00:07:44,227
This Djinn Equip itself

8253
00:07:44,227 --> 00:07:46,227
is where you release the full power of a Djinn.

8254
00:07:48,427 --> 00:07:50,947
Let's see how far can you endure.

8255
00:07:57,967 --> 00:07:59,107
Bararaq!

8256
00:08:07,987 --> 00:08:11,747
It's on a completely different level than before!

8257
00:08:21,507 --> 00:08:22,927
What was that just now!?

8258
00:08:23,427 --> 00:08:24,927
Just what in the hell happened here!?

8259
00:08:28,727 --> 00:08:30,227
Man that was so rough.

8260
00:08:39,947 --> 00:08:43,527
As it was quite noisy in there, I decided to change the location.

8261
00:08:45,667 --> 00:08:48,887
As I thought, this shield is like a full body barrier.

8262
00:08:50,727 --> 00:08:53,207
Now there, it'd be wise if you don't struggle

8263
00:08:53,427 --> 00:08:57,807
as my power can easily destroy a barrier of this level.

8264
00:08:59,007 --> 00:09:00,527
Are you really sure,

8265
00:09:00,527 --> 00:09:02,527
you want my hands off it?

8266
00:09:13,627 --> 00:09:14,887
As expected of someone of your caliber.

8267
00:09:16,127 --> 00:09:20,227
Not only you took my lightening head on, but can also withstand a fall like this.

8268
00:09:21,067 --> 00:09:24,027
The power of your metal vessel is really admirable..

8269
00:09:24,547 --> 00:09:26,787
Hmph, to think you'd go easy on me...

8270
00:09:27,647 --> 00:09:29,867
Don't act as if you've already won this.

8271
00:09:30,007 --> 00:09:35,407
Uh-oh, that was my bad, I thought I had shown you the difference in our power with that last skirmish.

8272
00:09:35,787 --> 00:09:37,567
But it looks like it wasn't enough.

8273
00:09:38,347 --> 00:09:41,287
I should've shown you this from the beginning.

8274
00:09:42,757 --> 00:09:45,047
Bara

8275
00:09:43,407 --> 00:09:45,047
raq

8276
00:09:44,037 --> 00:09:45,047
Saiqa!

8277
00:10:09,607 --> 00:10:12,107
All those mountains... in an instant...!?

8278
00:10:13,947 --> 00:10:15,507
Do you get it now?

8279
00:10:15,867 --> 00:10:17,587
That I can annihilate Sasan as a whole,

8280
00:10:17,767 --> 00:10:20,467
if I really feel like it.

8281
00:10:21,907 --> 00:10:24,747
Someone like you who hasn't learned his Djinn Equip yet,

8282
00:10:24,827 --> 00:10:26,247
can't possibly defeat me.

8283
00:10:27,027 --> 00:10:29,987
Even though we're both conquerors there is this much gap in our powers...!?

8284
00:10:29,987 --> 00:10:33,047
Yes, if my motive was invasion,

8285
00:10:33,047 --> 00:10:35,507
Sasan would've already fallen under me.

8286
00:10:36,207 --> 00:10:39,467
Even a Knight King like yourself couldn't have done anything about it..

8287
00:10:40,307 --> 00:10:45,307
Just who're you...?
With what objective have you come to this country!?

8288
00:10:46,107 --> 00:10:49,667
My objective is to start a trade route,

8289
00:10:49,807 --> 00:10:52,067
and form an alliance with this country.

8290
00:10:53,027 --> 00:10:56,027
To form an alliance on equal terms with Sasan.

8291
00:10:57,087 --> 00:10:58,907
My wish is just that.

8292
00:10:59,167 --> 00:10:59,987
What?

8293
00:11:00,807 --> 00:11:04,647
The reason for forcing you in a duel while knowing that I was being rude

8294
00:11:04,887 --> 00:11:06,927
was because I needed a place like this to negotiate with you.

8295
00:11:08,167 --> 00:11:11,607
O' Knight King, I apologize for my impolite behavior.

8296
00:11:13,427 --> 00:11:16,767
With this I can finally enter the main topic.

8297
00:11:17,487 --> 00:11:20,687
Right now, the people throughout the world have started conquering Dungeons,

8298
00:11:21,007 --> 00:11:22,927
and have started to gain power.

8299
00:11:23,607 --> 00:11:27,107
This power will eventually destroy the balance of this world

8300
00:11:27,147 --> 00:11:29,727
and will greatly influence the power equilibrium.

8301
00:11:30,787 --> 00:11:32,667
Even Sasan won't be an exception to that.

8302
00:11:33,027 --> 00:11:35,827
With things as of now, it will be pulled into the war whether you like it or not.

8303
00:11:37,107 --> 00:11:40,207
However, I do not wish for war.

8304
00:11:40,647 --> 00:11:44,927
Rather, I want to change this world which is filled with wars

8305
00:11:45,767 --> 00:11:50,927
and want to make it so that people... countries can understand each other.

8306
00:11:51,687 --> 00:11:53,547
I want to use my power for that.

8307
00:11:54,247 --> 00:11:56,547
A world where people will understand each other.

8308
00:11:57,127 --> 00:12:01,267
Do you really believe you can achieve something that foolish!?

8309
00:12:01,587 --> 00:12:05,287
Yes. I'll soon create a country and become a King.

8310
00:12:05,787 --> 00:12:09,547
So I'll need people who can share this dream with me at that time.

8311
00:12:10,407 --> 00:12:13,307
Comrades who will change the world with me.

8312
00:12:13,587 --> 00:12:15,947
Change the world...!?

8313
00:12:16,627 --> 00:12:21,727
For that, Sasan Kingdom's Knight King, 
Darius Leoxses!

8314
00:12:22,267 --> 00:12:24,787
Your powers are needed.

8315
00:12:22,707 --> 00:12:28,997
Visit us at
https://kamitranslation.wordpress.com/

8316
00:12:30,347 --> 00:12:32,967
It has been almost an hour since the Knight King vanished.

8317
00:12:33,827 --> 00:12:35,587
Just who're you!?

8318
00:12:35,707 --> 00:12:36,967
Now answer!

8319
00:12:38,047 --> 00:12:39,027
They've left us with no choiceâ

8320
00:12:45,267 --> 00:12:46,487
What is it now?

8321
00:12:55,667 --> 00:12:56,467
Knight King!

8322
00:12:56,647 --> 00:12:58,007
Are you alright?

8323
00:12:58,587 --> 00:13:00,107
What happened to the duel?

8324
00:13:02,247 --> 00:13:04,687
This duel was my...

8325
00:13:04,447 --> 00:13:05,627
It was a draw.

8326
00:13:06,447 --> 00:13:09,067
After exchanging our blades we understood

8327
00:13:09,747 --> 00:13:13,087
that both of us are the conquerors of the legendary tower who have this power of god.

8328
00:13:13,787 --> 00:13:15,807
And decided that it was pointless to go any further.

8329
00:13:16,907 --> 00:13:17,967
O' Knight King!

8330
00:13:18,267 --> 00:13:22,627
Wasn't the power of god supposed to be something that only a Knight King of Sasan could use!?

8331
00:13:23,387 --> 00:13:25,047
So just who is he...?

8332
00:13:26,227 --> 00:13:27,627
According to our legends,

8333
00:13:27,867 --> 00:13:31,247
the legendary tower only appears when there is unusual phenomenon occurring all across the world.

8334
00:13:32,427 --> 00:13:36,827
And that's exactly what is happening, as the world is suffering from abnormalities and chaos.

8335
00:13:37,847 --> 00:13:42,547
In other words, it would mean that he is also one of the chosen ones by the god.

8336
00:13:43,527 --> 00:13:48,787
Thus to protect the world from peril, I want to welcome him to Sasan as a comrade.

8337
00:13:50,927 --> 00:13:53,667
And also as an apostle who is chosen by the same god.

8338
00:13:56,607 --> 00:13:58,767
Your will is the will of God himself.

8339
00:13:59,307 --> 00:14:02,027
Every Knight in the Order will abide by that.

8340
00:14:02,627 --> 00:14:04,207
Let's welcome apostle Sinbad

8341
00:14:04,367 --> 00:14:06,827
for the bright future of Sasan!

8342
00:14:12,527 --> 00:14:14,287
And there it got concluded!

8343
00:14:22,307 --> 00:14:24,127
Are you leaving now, Mystras?

8344
00:14:26,827 --> 00:14:29,987
Yeah... I'm going with him.

8345
00:14:31,307 --> 00:14:34,627
I wasn't able to defeat you and leave on my own.

8346
00:14:35,527 --> 00:14:38,967
But I'm ready to discard my name and country.

8347
00:14:39,547 --> 00:14:40,487
Mystras...

8348
00:14:41,907 --> 00:14:45,007
As a Knight King...  and as your father...

8349
00:14:45,327 --> 00:14:47,727
I've always restrained you to this land

8350
00:14:48,927 --> 00:14:51,387
because I believed that it was my duty to do so.

8351
00:14:52,887 --> 00:14:53,707
But...

8352
00:14:54,167 --> 00:14:57,167
in reality I just might've been envious of you.

8353
00:14:57,367 --> 00:14:58,007
Eh?

8354
00:14:58,667 --> 00:15:01,667
When I was around your age,

8355
00:15:02,367 --> 00:15:04,467
there was a time when even I was captivated by the outside world.

8356
00:15:06,467 --> 00:15:08,387
But, I couldn't tell anybody about it.

8357
00:15:09,687 --> 00:15:10,607
Now go.

8358
00:15:11,467 --> 00:15:14,187
As a proof of alliance,

8359
00:15:14,347 --> 00:15:17,147
I give you a mission to accompany Sinbad!

8360
00:15:17,647 --> 00:15:20,667
So walk all around the world in my stead.

8361
00:15:22,667 --> 00:15:23,967
I...

8362
00:15:24,247 --> 00:15:26,767
was able to get stronger because of you.

8363
00:15:27,647 --> 00:15:29,967
It's because you were always there standing as a wall in front of me,

8364
00:15:30,447 --> 00:15:33,727
that I was able to hold on to my convictions.

8365
00:15:35,947 --> 00:15:36,767
That's why,

8366
00:15:38,447 --> 00:15:41,047
Thank You... Father...!

8367
00:15:44,527 --> 00:15:46,327
It gave me chills this time as well.

8368
00:15:46,967 --> 00:15:48,707
But it worked out in the end, didn't it?

8369
00:15:48,787 --> 00:15:52,247
Geez, It's we who have to always clean up your mess afterwards you know?

8370
00:15:52,427 --> 00:15:54,007
Sorry for the wait.

8371
00:15:54,767 --> 00:15:56,107
Are you done with the farewell?

8372
00:15:56,327 --> 00:16:00,367
Yes, now I can finally go to the outside world with a peace of mind.

8373
00:16:01,027 --> 00:16:02,267
It feels like a dream.

8374
00:16:02,727 --> 00:16:03,867
Now there,

8375
00:16:04,047 --> 00:16:06,187
I know that you're excited to go to the outside world.

8376
00:16:06,187 --> 00:16:08,187
But, I'll be putting you to work.

8377
00:16:08,187 --> 00:16:08,947
Work?

8378
00:16:09,467 --> 00:16:12,407
The alliance with Sasan also comes with a trade agreement.

8379
00:16:12,667 --> 00:16:15,667
You'll be in charge of communication with Sasan.

8380
00:16:16,727 --> 00:16:18,767
Ah, I completely forgot about that.

8381
00:16:18,887 --> 00:16:21,027
I wonder if I'll be able to manage it properly.

8382
00:16:21,247 --> 00:16:25,347
Father and others in the order will be angry if I cause you any trouble.

8383
00:16:25,347 --> 00:16:27,347
Please wait, Big-Brother!

8384
00:16:27,647 --> 00:16:30,507
Why are you leaving without saying anything to me?

8385
00:16:30,707 --> 00:16:31,747
Spartos...!

8386
00:16:32,167 --> 00:16:33,747
I heard from father.

8387
00:16:34,287 --> 00:16:38,287
That you're going to the outside world after being promoted from an apprentice to a holy knight.

8388
00:16:39,387 --> 00:16:41,587
You always keep important things from me...

8389
00:16:42,507 --> 00:16:44,627
Am I really a bother?

8390
00:16:45,907 --> 00:16:48,087
You're thinking too much, Spartos!

8391
00:16:48,927 --> 00:16:51,427
It's just that I've been too preoccupied with myself.

8392
00:16:52,467 --> 00:16:55,587
That's why I couldn't think about you properly.

8393
00:16:56,427 --> 00:16:57,227
Mystras...

8394
00:16:58,307 --> 00:17:03,287
"The truth is, I didn't want anything bad to happen to your future because of a vagabond like me,

8395
00:17:03,787 --> 00:17:06,527
so I decided to keep my distance from you"

8396
00:17:06,867 --> 00:17:07,867
Didn't you mean it like that?

8397
00:17:08,847 --> 00:17:09,867
Big-Brother...

8398
00:17:11,507 --> 00:17:14,547
No matter what people said about you,

8399
00:17:14,887 --> 00:17:18,347
you always yearned for the outside world, and aimed for it.

8400
00:17:18,887 --> 00:17:22,487
And always worked hard in order to achieve that, without complaining even once.

8401
00:17:23,187 --> 00:17:25,107
I know all about that.

8402
00:17:25,327 --> 00:17:28,847
That's why, I've always respected you from the bottom of my heart.

8403
00:17:30,167 --> 00:17:32,427
If I couldn't see you anymore...

8404
00:17:33,127 --> 00:17:36,007
I'll be very lonely

8405
00:17:39,747 --> 00:17:43,527
Don't worry, Spartos!
It's not like we'll never see each other again.

8406
00:17:44,627 --> 00:17:49,787
Let's travel the world together when you get a bit older and become a respectable knight.

8407
00:17:50,547 --> 00:17:53,347
At that time, even you'll be assigned to the same mission.

8408
00:17:54,927 --> 00:17:59,547
That's why don't cry. You won't be able to become strong if you keep crying.

8409
00:18:08,927 --> 00:18:10,747
<i>It's a promise between the two knights.</i>

8410
00:18:11,087 --> 00:18:12,747
See you later!

8411
00:18:13,507 --> 00:18:14,527
<i>Big-Brother...</i>

8412
00:18:15,047 --> 00:18:16,527
<i>I'll do my best!</i>

8413
00:18:17,347 --> 00:18:21,147
<i>So I can travel around the world just like you.</i>

8414
00:18:35,447 --> 00:18:37,767
O' Knight King, are you sure about this?

8415
00:18:38,307 --> 00:18:43,687
Sending Mystras, who has already been defeated in a duel, to accompany them in your stead.

8416
00:18:44,327 --> 00:18:45,147
It's fine.

8417
00:18:45,787 --> 00:18:50,607
Rather this might be Sasan's and my son's destiny.

8418
00:18:51,047 --> 00:18:51,687
Destiny?

8419
00:18:52,987 --> 00:18:54,047
<i>Sinbad...</i>

8420
00:18:55,287 --> 00:18:58,087
<i>As soon as that singularity arrived here in Sasan,</i>

8421
00:18:58,507 --> 00:19:02,507
<i>a change has begun which has never happened in our history for hundreds of years.</i>

8422
00:19:03,847 --> 00:19:07,527
<i>What if this is the destiny written by god...</i>

8423
00:19:11,387 --> 00:19:13,767
Change the world...!?<i></i>

8424
00:19:14,467 --> 00:19:19,147
For that, Sasan Kingdom's Knight King, 
Darius Leoxses!<i></i>

8425
00:19:20,007 --> 00:19:22,367
Your powers are needed.<i></i>

8426
00:19:26,147 --> 00:19:27,147
It's strange.<i></i>

8427
00:19:29,107 --> 00:19:32,927
When I look at you, it reminds me of the old legend.<i></i>

8428
00:19:33,347 --> 00:19:34,127
Legend...?<i></i>

8429
00:19:34,127 --> 00:19:36,127
Yeah...<i></i>

8430
00:19:36,407 --> 00:19:39,287
You know that we have our own belief here in Sasan, right?<i></i>

8431
00:19:40,567 --> 00:19:42,987
The beginning of our legend goes like this.

8432
00:19:44,927 --> 00:19:48,127
...Long ago when the world was overflowing with impurities,<i></i>

8433
00:19:48,887 --> 00:19:51,207
the people of Sasan came to this land<i></i>

8434
00:19:51,667 --> 00:19:57,187
and used the power of god that they had brought from their distant birthplace to clear the impurities.<i></i>

8435
00:19:58,407 --> 00:20:01,427
That God was an omnipotent King...<i></i>

8436
00:20:01,987 --> 00:20:04,367
A Great King who guarded our ancestors.<i></i>

8437
00:20:04,687 --> 00:20:08,007
He suppressed the disputes of the world by using his divine instrument,<i></i>

8438
00:20:08,327 --> 00:20:11,687
and even formed an utopia where all races lived in harmony.<i></i>

8439
00:20:12,627 --> 00:20:14,707
First king whose existence was that of a god...<i></i>

8440
00:20:16,187 --> 00:20:18,447
Isn't that quite similar to what you're aiming?<i></i>

8441
00:20:19,447 --> 00:20:21,707
May I ask you the name of that god...?<i></i>

8442
00:20:22,027 --> 00:20:25,487
His name was lost a long time ago.<i></i>

8443
00:20:27,667 --> 00:20:32,207
<i>From now on, the world might change a lot with him at the centre.</i>

8444
00:20:33,127 --> 00:20:36,207
<i>Though he is a conqueror, he is still a child...</i>

8445
00:20:37,467 --> 00:20:39,907
<i>Did I accept his alliance</i>

8446
00:20:40,367 --> 00:20:44,607
<i>just because my intution led me to compare him with god?</i>

8447
00:20:46,927 --> 00:20:49,207
<i>O' God who governs us all!</i>

8448
00:20:49,807 --> 00:20:50,947
<i>Please...</i>

8449
00:20:51,667 --> 00:20:53,247
<i>...guide them!</i>

8450
00:20:54,907 --> 00:20:56,027
So this is...

8451
00:20:57,287 --> 00:20:58,027
...the sea!

8452
00:21:00,347 --> 00:21:04,467
Sinbad-san, to be honest I was a bit scared.

8453
00:21:05,507 --> 00:21:08,967
That what would I do if the world that I've always yearned for

8454
00:21:09,707 --> 00:21:12,407
ended up failing my expectations.

8455
00:21:13,427 --> 00:21:15,487
I was wondering about that in my heart all this time.

8456
00:21:16,267 --> 00:21:19,007
But that blew away in an instant.

8457
00:21:19,807 --> 00:21:23,087
I want to know more about this world!

8458
00:21:24,087 --> 00:21:28,847
So where will we go next?
I'll follow you to the end of the world.

8459
00:21:29,287 --> 00:21:30,847
Ah, about that.

8460
00:21:31,467 --> 00:21:34,047
Our plan is to head towards yet another small country like this.

8461
00:21:34,387 --> 00:21:38,267
Isn't that gonna be a big country like Reim or Partevia?

8462
00:21:38,507 --> 00:21:42,107
Yes. What's more is that it's even more peculiar than sasan.

8463
00:21:42,347 --> 00:21:44,407
A place for which we got an immigration permit after so much trouble.

8464
00:21:44,707 --> 00:21:46,607
Truly an epitome of all unexplored regions.

8465
00:21:47,667 --> 00:21:50,927
A matriarchal nation ruled by a war maiden.

8466
00:21:51,947 --> 00:21:54,647
City of the Sky, 
Artemyra Kingdom!

8467
00:21:56,387 --> 00:21:58,667
So that's how it is, Mystras

8468
00:21:59,107 --> 00:22:02,727
I apologize but we also have reasons.

8469
00:22:03,687 --> 00:22:04,587
What happened?

8470
00:22:05,067 --> 00:22:06,087
Mystras...?

8471
00:22:08,407 --> 00:22:12,087
What? Are you serious? What the hell?

8472
00:22:12,927 --> 00:22:15,607
So what do you think about the outside world?

8473
00:22:15,927 --> 00:22:17,607
It's great, isn't it?

8474
00:22:22,707 --> 00:22:25,507
YâYes!

8475
00:22:35,527 --> 00:22:38,407
It's because my face was boring

8476
00:22:35,527 --> 00:22:38,407
kagami ni utsuru jibun ga

8477
00:22:38,407 --> 00:22:41,327
that I was reflected in the mirror like that

8478
00:22:38,407 --> 00:22:41,327
saenai kao wo shiteta kara

8479
00:22:41,327 --> 00:22:44,167
The dream I saw of flying in the sky

8480
00:22:41,327 --> 00:22:44,167
kinou mita sora wo tobu yume

8481
00:22:44,167 --> 00:22:46,957
has now started flowing inside my eyes

8482
00:22:44,167 --> 00:22:46,957
hitomi no oku de ugokidasu

8483
00:22:46,957 --> 00:22:49,837
If only I had a bit of courage

8484
00:22:46,957 --> 00:22:49,837
sukoshi no yuuki ga arunara

8485
00:22:49,837 --> 00:22:52,797
I could've flown at anytime

8486
00:22:49,837 --> 00:22:52,797
itsudemo tobidaseru no ni

8487
00:22:52,797 --> 00:22:58,427
A breeze rushed across the shore

8488
00:22:52,797 --> 00:22:58,427
oounabara ni kaze ga fuiteta yo

8489
00:22:58,427 --> 00:23:03,307
If you stretch your hands

8490
00:22:58,427 --> 00:23:03,307
te wo hirogereba

8491
00:23:03,307 --> 00:23:12,737
A new world will connect

8492
00:23:03,307 --> 00:23:12,737
atarashii sekai ga tsunagaru

8493
00:23:15,447 --> 00:23:20,957
Grasp your body and soul together!

8494
00:23:15,447 --> 00:23:20,957
zenshinzenrei subete wo tsukamu yo!

8495
00:23:20,957 --> 00:23:26,877
There is a new born hope in my hands

8496
00:23:20,957 --> 00:23:26,877
boku no tenonaka ni wa umaretate no kibou

8497
00:23:26,877 --> 00:23:32,507
I wonder what you could see

8498
00:23:26,877 --> 00:23:32,507
habataku tsubasa so nosaki ni

8499
00:23:32,507 --> 00:23:38,347
across those wings of yours? Will I ever know?

8500
00:23:32,507 --> 00:23:38,347
nani ga mieru? wakaru darou

8501
00:23:38,347 --> 00:23:43,977
Together with these feelings of mine

8502
00:23:38,347 --> 00:23:43,977
takanaru kimochi tomo ni

8503
00:23:43,977 --> 00:23:53,027
Let's start our journey!

8504
00:23:43,977 --> 00:23:53,027
kono mama ima tabi ni de yo

